,"ssh_url":"git@github.com:typeorm/typeorm.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm","homepage":"http://typeorm.io","size":33014,"stargazers_count":36125,"watchers_count":36125,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6469,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":540,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["active-record","cockroachdb","data-mapper","database","electron","hacktoberfest","javascript","mariadb","mysql","oracle","orm","postgresql","react-native","sap","sap-hana","sqlite","sqlserver","typeorm","typescript","websql"],"visibility":"public","forks":6469,"open_issues":540,"watchers":36125,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"In the following example, Is it possible to join the `ModelReview` and `ItemInfo` tables via `modelId`, which isn't a primary column in `ItemInfo` ?\r\n\r\nWith this query:\r\n\r\n````\r\n this.entityManager.createQueryBuilder(ModelReview, \"m\")\r\n                .innerJoinAndSelect(`m.itemInfo`, 'i')\r\n                .where(\"m.postId=:postId\")\r\n                .setParameter(\"postId\", postId)\r\n                .getMany()\r\n````\r\nThe raw query ends up like this:\r\n\r\n````\r\n FROM `model_review` `m` INNER JOIN `item_info` `i` ON `i`.`mid`=`m`.`modelId` WHERE `m`.`postId`=:postId\r\n````\r\nHowever, I was expecting this:\r\n\r\n FROM `model_review` `m` INNER JOIN `item_info` `i` ON **`i`.`modelId`**=`m`.`modelId` WHERE `m`.`postId`=:postId\r\n\r\nHow can I get the above result? I thought     \r\n`@OneToOne(type=>ItemInfo,entity=>entity.modelId)` would tell the script to join `ItemInfo` via modelId, but it doesn't work.\r\n\r\n\r\n````\r\nexport class ModelReview{\r\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\r\n    postId: number;\r\n\r\n    @OneToOne(type=>ItemInfo,entity=>entity.modelId)\r\n    @JoinColumn({name:'modelId'})\r\n    itemInfo:ItemInfo;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type:'int'}) // << THIS\r\n    modelId:number;\r\n}\r\n````\r\n\r\n````\r\nexport class ItemInfo{\r\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\r\n    variantId: number;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type:'int'}) // << JOINS THIS\r\n    modelId:number;\r\n}\r\n````\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/508/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1155569861,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTE1NTU2OTg2MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/events/1155569861","actor":{"login":"pleerock","id":1753397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTMzOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1753397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock","html_url":"https://github.com/pleerock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pleerock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"even