https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/deployments","created_at":"2016-02-29T07:41:14Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T16:46:06Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T10:50:18Z","git_url":"git://github.com/typeorm/typeorm.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:typeorm/typeorm.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm","homepage":"http://typeorm.io","size":33014,"stargazers_count":36125,"watchers_count":36125,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6469,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":540,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["active-record","cockroachdb","data-mapper","database","electron","hacktoberfest","javascript","mariadb","mysql","oracle","orm","postgresql","react-native","sap","sap-hana","sqlite","sqlserver","typeorm","typescript","websql"],"visibility":"public","forks":6469,"open_issues":540,"watchers":36125,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I'm getting the error from this table `RelatedItem` in `0.1.0-alpha.3` https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/495.  \r\nThe usage of `referencedColumnName` is the culprit of the issue. Without it, I don't get any error:\r\n\r\n````\r\nError: Index \"idx_related_items\" contains columns that are missing in the entity: modelNo, relatedmodelNo\r\n````\r\n\r\nExample Tables:\r\n\r\n````\r\n@Entity()\r\n@Index(\"idx_related_items\", (post: RelatedItems) => [post.modelNo,post.relatedmodelNo])\r\nexport class RelatedItems{\r\n\r\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\r\n    postId: number;\r\n\r\n    @OneToOne(type=>Item,entity=>entity.modelNo)\r\n    @JoinColumn({name:'modelNo'})\r\n    item:Item;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type:'int'})\r\n    modelNo:number;\r\n\r\n    @OneToOne(type=>Item,entity=>entity.modelNo)\r\n    @JoinColumn({name:'relatedmodelNo',referencedColumnName:'modelNo'})\r\n    relatedItem:Item;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type:'int',nullable:true})\r\n    relatedmodelNo:number;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type:'text',nullable:true})\r\n    comment:string;\r\n}\r\n````\r\n\r\nItem:\r\n\r\n````\r\n@Entity()\r\nexport class Item {\r\n\r\n    @PrimaryGeneratedColumn()\r\n    vid: number;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type: 'int', nullable: true})\r\n    modelNo: number;\r\n\r\n    @Column({type: 'text'})\r\n    overviews: string;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n````\r\nI just debugged on this part in IndexMetaData.js\r\n````\r\n            var missingColumnNames = columnPropertyNames_1.filter(function (columnPropertyName) {\r\n                return !_this.entityMetadata.columns.find(function (column) { return column.propertyPath === columnPropertyName; }) &&\r\n                    !_this.entityMetadata.relations.find(function (relation) { return relation.isWithJoinColumn && relation.propertyPath === columnPropertyName; });\r\n            });\r\n````\r\nThere are missing columns because the column.propertyPath doesn't match the columnPropertyName:\r\n\r\n`modelNo` from RelatedItems is `vid.modelNo` in `column.propertyPath`, and `relatedmodelNo` is `modelNo.relatedmodelNo`. ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/630/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2212576782,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDIyMTI1NzY3ODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/events/2212576782","actor":{"login":"bbakhrom","id":20213433,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjEzNDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20213433?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom","html_url":"https://github.com/bbakhrom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbakhrom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"5c6679a71bee8a7608b4dd461c83c50ad04aa4ed","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/commits/5c6679a71bee8a7608b4dd461c83c50ad04aa4ed","created_at":"2019-03-19T07:00:12Z","performed_via_github_app":null}]